## UC10: Login to System
**Scenario:** A user authenticates to gain access to the POS system.
**Triggering event:** User needs to access the system.
**Actors:** Cashier, Administrator
**Related use cases:** all others (precondition for most)
**Stakeholders:** Cashier, Administrator, Owner
**Preconditions:** User has a valid, active account.
**Postconditions:** User is authenticated and granted access appropriate to their role.

**Main flow:**
| Actor | System |
|---|---|
| 1. Enters username and password | 1.1 Validate credentials |
| 2. Submits | 1.2 Authenticate and determine role |
| | 1.3 Grant role-based access |

**Exception conditions:** Invalid credentials; disabled account.

**SSD:**
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Cashier/Administrator
    participant System as :System
    User->>System: login(username, password)
    System-->>User: authenticationResult, dashboard(role)
```

