## UC11: Add Product
**Scenario:** Authorized staff add a new electronic product/gadget to inventory.
**Triggering event:** A new product needs to be listed for sale.
**Actors:** Administrator / Inventory Staff
**Related use cases:** Update Product Information
**Stakeholders:** Administrator, Owner
**Preconditions:** Administrator is logged in.
**Postconditions:** Product (and its Inventory record) is created.

**Main flow:**
| Actor | System |
|---|---|
| 1. Selects "Add Product" | 1.1 Display product entry form |
| 2. Enters product details (name, brand, price, barcode, description, initial stock) | 1.2 Validate input |
| 3. Submits | 1.3 Create Product record and initial Inventory record |

**Exception conditions:** Duplicate barcode; invalid/missing required fields.

**SSD:**
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Administrator
    participant System as :System
    Administrator->>System: addProduct(details)
    System-->>Administrator: confirmation, productID
```

