## UC12: Update Product Information
**Scenario:** Authorized staff update product details.
**Triggering event:** Price, description, or stock details need to change.
**Actors:** Administrator / Inventory Staff
**Related use cases:** Add Product
**Stakeholders:** Administrator, Owner
**Preconditions:** Product exists.
**Postconditions:** Product record is updated.

**Main flow:**
| Actor | System |
|---|---|
| 1. Selects product | 1.1 Retrieve current product details |
| 2. Edits details | 1.2 Validate changes |
| 3. Saves | 1.3 Update product record |

**Exception conditions:** Invalid data entered.

**SSD:**
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Administrator
    participant System as :System
    Administrator->>System: selectProduct(productID)
    System-->>Administrator: productDetails
    Administrator->>System: updateProduct(productID, changes)
    System-->>Administrator: confirmation
```

