## UC13: Remove Product
**Scenario:** The administrator removes a discontinued product.
**Triggering event:** A product is no longer sold by the store.
**Actors:** Administrator
**Related use cases:** Update Product Information
**Stakeholders:** Administrator, Owner
**Preconditions:** Product exists.
**Postconditions:** Product is removed (or marked discontinued) and no longer sellable.

**Main flow:**
| Actor | System |
|---|---|
| 1. Selects product | 1.1 Prompt for removal confirmation |
| 2. Confirms removal | 1.2 Mark/remove product record |

**Exception conditions:** Product has an active/pending sale referencing it — system should flag rather than hard-delete.

**SSD:**
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Administrator
    participant System as :System
    Administrator->>System: removeProduct(productID)
    System-->>Administrator: confirmationPrompt
    Administrator->>System: confirmRemoval()
    System-->>Administrator: productRemoved
```

