## UC14: Manage User Accounts
**Scenario:** The administrator creates, updates, or disables user accounts.
**Triggering event:** Staffing changes (new hire, role change, departure).
**Actors:** Administrator
**Related use cases:** Login to System
**Stakeholders:** Administrator, Owner
**Preconditions:** Administrator is logged in.
**Postconditions:** User account is created, updated, or disabled with the correct role.

**Main flow:**
| Actor | System |
|---|---|
| 1. Selects "Manage Users" | 1.1 Display user list |
| 2. Creates/edits/disables an account, assigns a role | 1.2 Validate input |
| | 1.3 Create/update account record |

**Exception conditions:** Username already taken; cannot disable the last remaining administrator account.

**SSD:**
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Administrator
    participant System as :System
    Administrator->>System: createUserAccount(details, role)
    System-->>Administrator: confirmation
    Administrator->>System: disableUserAccount(userID)
    System-->>Administrator: confirmation
```

