## UC15: View Sales Report
**Scenario:** The administrator views sales performance over a period.
**Triggering event:** Administrator needs sales insight (daily/weekly/monthly).
**Actors:** Administrator
**Related use cases:** Export Sales Data
**Stakeholders:** Administrator, Owner
**Preconditions:** Sales data exists for the requested period.
**Postconditions:** Sales report is displayed.

**Main flow:**
| Actor | System |
|---|---|
| 1. Selects report period (day/week/month) | 1.1 Query sales records for period |
| 2. Requests report | 1.2 Aggregate totals, generate report |
| | 1.3 Display report |

**Exception conditions:** No sales data for the selected period.

**SSD:**
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Administrator
    participant System as :System
    Administrator->>System: requestSalesReport(period)
    System-->>Administrator: salesReport
```

